# Git attributes — line-ending enforcement
# Created: 2026-04-22 (Phase B continuity bridge implementation)
#
# Context: Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true will reintroduce CRLF line
# endings into shell scripts on every checkout. WSL bash fails hard on CRLF
# ("$'\r': command not found"). Phase B scan-secrets.sh --stdin is invoked from
# continuity-append.mjs running under WSL (Hermes-Telegram surface), so durable
# LF on scripts/*.sh is required.

scripts/*.sh text eol=lf

# Deployed to Linux verbatim: CRLF here breaks the shebang at the far end.
scripts/launchers/radar-db-backup -text
scripts/launchers/hermes-backup.sh -text
